    "title": "Middle school football: Gilbert blanks Kermit Blue Devils - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Paul Adkins Sports Writer ,\n8 hours ago Ashton Epling scored three touchdowns and scored all 20 points for the Gilbert Middle School football team as the Lions blanked Kermit, 20-0 on Wednesday, Sept. 30 at Kermit. Epling scored on touchdown runs of 2, 62 and 5 as Gilbert improved to 2-2 overall and 1-1 in county play. Kermit dropped to 1-2, 0-1. Epling also scored on a two-point conversion run. Read full article",
